+    util/android/test_runner.py gtest -s libyuv_unittest -t 7200 --verbose --release --gtest_filter=* -a "--libyuv_width=1280 --libyuv_height=720 --libyuv_repeat=999 --libyuv_flags=-1"
+
+Running test with C code:
